TI  - [SGMAY] Predicting Non-suicidal Self-Injury and Suicidal Ideation Among University Students: A Cross-Sectional Study
AU  - S. M. Rakibul Hasan
AU  - Tasnim Tamanna
AU  - Md Emran Hasan
AU  - Mahjabin Tasnim Sadia
AU  - A. Mahmud
AU  - Abu Bakar Siddique
