AB  - [SGINC: on-topic] When development took place, it has positive impact in the society. Advancement in technology especially technological evolution also brings changes in the society. It improves our social life, it brings development in education and health system and moreover it made life easier. Internet which is one of the most important outcome of advancement in technology plays a crucial role in development of the society. Governments spent huge amount on internet connection which will be available even in rural areas. However, progress in this area also brings negative impact in the society. Social life becomes improved but new form of crimes emerges. Cyber crime which never known before internet connection becomes a threat in the society. Governments and authorities take various steps for prevention of cyber crimes by launching different sensitization programmes and organizing different awareness programmes. As cyber crime happens not only in the capital of India but also leave it marks in every area, taking proper steps for prevention and controlling this crime is necessary. Even though different steps are taken to prevent cyber crimes, this crime still cause massive financial losses and continue to disrupt the society. This study aims to analyze the effect of cyber crime in the state of Mizoram. Primary data has been collected from Cyber Crime Police Station, Aizawl which is the only Cyber Crime Police Station established in the State.
