TI  - [SGMAY] AHIMSA IN THE ALGORITHM AGE: REVIVING NON-VIOLENCE AND KARMA FROM ANCIENT INDIAN TEXT TO PREVENT AND REMEDY DIGITAL HARMS IN CYBERCRIMES
AU  - E. DEEPA
AU  - E. NAGARAJA
PY  - 2026
