TI  - [SGINC] Artificial Intelligence, Data Breaches and the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023: Assessing the Adequacy of India's Legal Framework: A Comparative Study
AU  - Ashish Kumar Himdhar
AU  - Shradha Pandey
PY  - 2026
