TI  - [SGINC] SOCIAL MEDIA ADDICTION AND CYBERBULLYING PERPETRATION: A COMPARATIVE STUDY OF GENDER IN PAKISTAN
AU  - Andleeb Awan
AU  - Saira Jabeen
AU  - Sana Tabassum
AU  - Jahangir Ashraf
AU  - Aasia Sameer Arif
AU  - Shah Jahan Ashraf
AU  - Zeeshan Mehfooz Sindhu
AU  - Ahmed Yasir Javed
