TI  - [SGINC] Coping with Public and Private Face-to-Face and Cyber Victimization among Adolescents in Six Countries: Roles of Severity and Country
AU  - Michelle F. Wright
AU  - Sebastian Wachs
AU  - Takuya Yanagida
AU  - Anna Ševčíková
AU  - Lenka Dědková
