TI  - [SGINC] Requirement of Strong Legal Framework and Procedures to Contest with Cybercrime in Pandemic Situation: Dr. Aftab Ahmad Malik, Dr. Mujtaba Asad, Dr. Waqar Azeem
AU  - Aftab Ahmad Malik
AU  - Mujtaba Asad
AU  - Waqar Azeem
