zed the best possible research method to obtain credible results and qualitative research approach. This section will elaborate research approach, design, and analysis adopted to reach the desired outcome for the study. In this regard, the study is Doctrinal, consider secondary source of data to conceptualize and contextualize the understanding of Cyber crime. Secondary source include journals, books, newspaper, magazines, libraries of different universities and institutes, judgments of the Hon'ble Supreme Court and High Courts.
